'''{{PAGENAME}}''', also known as "'''Labrys'''", is a [[Map of Tarkov|location]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''. It is the eleventh map that was added to the game. 

==Description==
A facility of one of TerraGroup's contractors, Knossos LLC. According to public sources, they build amusement and theme parks. However, this place looks more like a heavily fortified bunker than a new theme park.

==Notes==
This location can only be entered with a [[Labrys access keycard]] through [[Transits|transiting]] from [[Shoreline]]. The transit is located in the basement of the health resort west wing and requires the [[Knossos LLC facility key]].
