==Trivia==
* This location was released together with the video [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hu71GKZQkDo "The Λabyrinth"].
* [[Scavs]] in this location are better equipped than regular ones and sometimes carry [[xTG-12 antidote injector|xTG-12 injector]]s.
* Scavs in this location have Greek mythology names such as Μορφέας (Morpheus) and Πύθων (Python). This follows the overall Greek theme of related entities (Knossos, Ariadne) and items (Labrys).

